			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="width:192px;">
			<p><strong><u>Breakthrough Pain</u></strong></p>

			<p>If using SR opioids ATC, rx IR opioid for breakthrough pain. Breakthrough dose is 10-15% of the 24h total daily opioid dose, available q1-2h.</p>

			<p> </p>

			<p>If using 3 or more rescue doses daily, consider increasing ATC dose.</p>
			</td>
