			<p>30 mg</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width:108px;">
			<p>15 mg for both IR and SR formulations</p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="3" style="width:192px;">
			<p><strong><u>Opioid Conversions</u></strong></p>

			<ul>
				<li>Calculate 24h total opioid dose</li>
				<li>Convert to desired opioid (equivalent 24h dose) using equianalgesic table to left.</li>
				<li>Divide 24h dose of new opioid by the number of doses given per day.</li>
				<li>Reduce calculated dose of new opioid by 25% -50% for incomplete cross-tolerance; titrate up as needed.</li>
			</ul>
			</td>
